{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>BUY UNITS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase units to add them to your army. Spend your coin wisely to maximize your effectiveness in battle. Three options of purchasable units are available to you and are randomized every time you roll.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.poster.avif?t=1757718988\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.webm?t=1757718988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.mp4?t=1757718988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>UPGRADES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgraded versions of your units, and if you get lucky, purchase upgrades for you to utilize throughout your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.poster.avif?t=1757718988\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.webm?t=1757718988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.mp4?t=1757718988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>WAGE WAR</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you enter a battle, arrange your troops in a way that gives you the highest chance of winning. Each unit has its strengths and weaknesses, so think strategically; you only have three lives per run!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/6310c86dc75c8e490f39f9c01c5e0295.poster.avif?t=1757718988\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/6310c86dc75c8e490f39f9c01c5e0295.webm?t=1757718988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/6310c86dc75c8e490f39f9c01c5e0295.mp4?t=1757718988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860340?t=1757718988","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860340?t=1757718988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/653e8f4c94bd5404b512d6f0b0e5691fdae2381e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757718988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/653e8f4c94bd5404b512d6f0b0e5691fdae2381e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757718988","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3974000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>BUY UNITS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase units to add them to your army. Spend your coin wisely to maximize your effectiveness in battle. Three options of purchasable units are available to you and are randomized every time you roll.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.poster.avif?t=1757718988\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.webm?t=1757718988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.mp4?t=1757718988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>UPGRADES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgraded versions of your units, and if you get lucky, purchase upgrades for you to utilize throughout your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.poster.avif?t=1757718988\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.webm?t=1757718988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860340/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.mp4?t=1757718988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>WAGE WAR</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you enter a battle, arrange your troops in a way that gives you the highest chance of winning. Each unit has its strengths and weaknesses, so think strategically; you only have three lives per run!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset